  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CCDMP 2022-2025: SNV - Programme Agroalimentaire pour la R&#xe9;silience Int&#xe9;gr&#xe9;e et le D&#xe9;veloppement &#xc9;conomique au Sahel (Pro-ARIDES)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to &quot;contribute to increased resilience, food security and income of agricultural and agro-pastoral households in the Sudano-Sahelian zone of Burkina Faso, Mali and Niger through effective decentralized institutions and organizations for service delivery, improved natural resource and land management and local economic development.&quot; The programme is implemented through five (5) pathways, interdependent and complementary, which will achieve systemic and sustainable change.</narrative>
  </description>
